nagers are actually the Sailor Stars, warriors in search of the Princess of their planet which was destroyed. This is the final series in the \"Sailor Moon\" trilogy.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.5}],"value":8.5,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":4163,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}